# hair/adult/bald: Bald: no hair; the head type's own skull (its lit crown) shows (STYLE_P2 21). The part exists so the style
# resolves; FACES' head types draw the skull top seen when bald.
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (man and woman). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair bald
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin 0 0
|.

view L key rest origin 0 0
|.
